<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-br">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Swagger UI - RvCarbon Complete API</title>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2pdf.js/0.10.1/html2pdf.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        /* --- CSS SWAGGER GENUINE STYLE --- */
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #fafafa; font-family: sans-serif; color: #3b4151; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }

        /* Topbar */
        .topbar { background-color: #1b1b1b; padding: 10px 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; height: 60px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        .logo { font-weight: bold; color: white; font-size: 24px; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; }
        .logo span { color: #89bf04; } 
        .search-bar { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 10px; }
        .fake-input { background: #fff; border: 2px solid #89bf04; padding: 5px 10px; border-radius: 4px; width: 300px; font-size: 13px; color: #3b4151; }
        .btn-explore { background: #89bf04; color: white; border: none; padding: 6px 15px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }

        /* Layout */
        .container { max-width: 1460px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }

        /* Header Info */
        .info-header { margin: 20px 0 40px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 20px; }
        .info-title { font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
        .badge { font-size: 10px; background: #7d8492; color: white; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 15px; vertical-align: middle; }
        .info-desc { margin-top: 15px; font-size: 14px; color: #3b4151; max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.6; }
        .base-url { font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; background: #333; color: white; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 10px; display: inline-block; }
        
        .btn-pdf {
            background: white; border: 2px solid #4990e2; color: #4990e2; 
            padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;
            float: right; transition: all 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;
        }
        .btn-pdf:hover { background: #4990e2; color: white; }

        /* Sections (Tags) */
        .op-block-tag { 
            font-size: 24px; margin: 30px 0 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59,65,81,.2); 
            padding-bottom: 10px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
            font-family: sans-serif; font-weight: 700; color: #3b4151;
        }
        .op-block-tag:hover { color: #4990e2; border-color: #4990e2; }
        
        /* Operation Blocks (Accordions) */
        .op-block {
            border: 1px solid #000; border-radius: 4px; margin: 0 0 15px; box-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(0,0,0,.19);
            background: white; overflow: hidden; transition: height 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Method Colors */
        .op-block.post { border-color: #49cc90; background: rgba(73,204,144,.1); }
        .op-block.post .op-block-summary-method { background: #49cc90; }
        .op-block.post .op-block-body { border-top: 1px solid #49cc90; }

        .op-block.get { border-color: #61affe; background: rgba(97,175,254,.1); }
        .op-block.get .op-block-summary-method { background: #61affe; }
        .op-block.get .op-block-body { border-top: 1px solid #61affe; }

        .op-block.put { border-color: #fca130; background: rgba(252,161,48,.1); }
        .op-block.put .op-block-summary-method { background: #fca130; }
        .op-block.put .op-block-body { border-top: 1px solid #fca130; }

        .op-block.patch { border-color: #50e3c2; background: rgba(80,227,194,.1); }
        .op-block.patch .op-block-summary-method { background: #50e3c2; }
        .op-block.patch .op-block-body { border-top: 1px solid #50e3c2; }

        .op-block.delete { border-color: #f93e3e; background: rgba(249,62,62,.1); }
        .op-block.delete .op-block-summary-method { background: #f93e3e; }
        .op-block.delete .op-block-body { border-top: 1px solid #f93e3e; }

        /* Summary Header */
        .op-block-summary { padding: 5px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .op-block-summary-method {
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; min-width: 80px; padding: 6px 15px; text-align: center; border-radius: 3px; color: white; text-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.1); margin-right: 10px;
        }
        .op-block-summary-path { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #3b4151; flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; font-family: monospace; }
        .op-block-summary-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #3b4151; margin-left: 10px; flex: 1; }
        .arrow { width: 20px; height: 20px; fill: #3b4151; transition: transform 0.2s; margin-right: 10px; }

        /* Body Details */
        .op-block-body { padding: 20px; background: #fff; display: none; }
        
        .section-header { font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0 10px; color: #3b4151; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
        
        /* Interactive "Try it out" */
        .try-out-wrapper { background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; padding: 10px; margin-top: 20px; border-radius: 4px; }
        .try-btn { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #3b4151; color: #3b4151; padding: 5px 15px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .try-btn:hover { background: #3b4151; color: white; }
        
        .execute-panel { display: none; margin-top: 10px; }
        .execute-btn { background: #4990e2; color: white; border: none; padding: 8px 40px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; display: block; margin-top: 10px; }
        .execute-btn:hover { background: #357abd; }
        
        .req-editor { width: 100%; min-height: 150px; background: #333; color: #fff; font-family: monospace; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #555; }
        .response-box { margin-top: 15px; background: #292b2c; color: #85d77c; padding: 10px; font-family: monospace; border-radius: 4px; white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 12px; display: none; }
        .response-status { font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; display: block; color: #fff; }

        /* Data Display */
        .model-box { 
            background: #333; color: #fff; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; 
            font-family: "Source Code Pro", monospace; font-size: 12px; overflow-x: auto; margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .model-box pre { margin: 0; }
        
        /* Syntax Highlight */
        .highlight { color: #dcb67a; } /* Keys */
        .string { color: #a5c261; }
        .number { color: #ffc66d; }
        .boolean { color: #cc7832; }
        .comment { color: #808080; font-style: italic; }

        /* Tables */
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
        th { text-align: left; padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59,65,81,.2); color: #3b4151; font-weight: bold; }
        td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59,65,81,.2); vertical-align: top; color: #3b4151; }
        
        /* Badges */
        .status-badge { display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; color: white; margin-right: 5px; }
        .status-200 { background: #49cc90; }
        .status-201 { background: #49cc90; }
        .status-204 { background: #49cc90; }
        .status-400 { background: #f93e3e; }
        .status-401 { background: #fca130; }
        .status-403 { background: #fca130; }
        .status-404 { background: #f93e3e; }
        .status-302 { background: #9013fe; } /* Redirect */

        .service-rule { 
            background: #fff8e1; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; padding: 10px; margin: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #5f4b06;
        }
        
        .error-example {
            background: #ffe6e6; border-left: 4px solid #f93e3e; padding: 10px; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 12px; font-family: monospace; color: #a94442;
        }
        .validation-list {
            background: #e3f2fd; border-radius: 4px; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; font-size: 13px;
        }
        .validation-list ul { margin: 5px 0 0 20px; padding: 0; }
        .validation-list li { margin-bottom: 4px; color: #0d47a1; }

        /* Schemas Section */
        .models-section { margin-top: 60px; border-top: 1px solid #3b4151; padding-top: 20px; }
        .model-container { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.2s; }
        .model-container:hover { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .model-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: #3b4151; margin-bottom: 10px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
        .model-content { display: none; padding: 10px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 13px; background: white; border-radius: 4px; }
        .prop-req { color: #f93e3e; font-weight: bold; font-size: 10px; }

        .rotate { transform: rotate(180deg); }

        /* Flow Diagram */
        .flow-diagram { 
            background: #eef7ff; border: 1px dashed #4990e2; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 13px; color: #333;
        }
        .flow-step { margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: start; gap: 10px; }
        .step-num { background: #4990e2; color: white; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; flex-shrink: 0; }
        
        /* Module Divider */
        .module-divider {
            margin: 60px 0;
            border-top: 4px solid #1b1b1b;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .module-divider span {
            background: #fafafa;
            position: relative;
            top: -12px;
            padding: 0 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1b1b1b;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="topbar">
        <a href="#" class="logo">swagger<span>ui</span></a>
        <div class="search-bar">
            <input type="text" class="fake-input" value="https://api.rvcarbon.com.br/v1/openapi.json" disabled>
            <button class="btn-explore">Explore</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container" id="printable-area">
        
        <!-- ==================== PART 1: AUTH CONTROLLER ==================== -->
        
        <div class="info-header">
            <button onclick="generatePDF()" class="btn-pdf">Export PDF</button>
            <h1 class="info-title">
                RvCarbonApi
                <span class="badge">1.0.0</span>
                <span class="badge" style="background:#49cc90;">OAS 3.0</span>
            </h1>
            <div class="base-url">[ Base URL: https://api.rvcarbon.com.br/ ]</div>
            <p class="info-desc">
                Documentação oficial da API RvCarbon.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- AUTH CONTROLLER SECTION -->
        <div class="op-block-tag" onclick="toggleSection('auth-container')">
            <span>Auth Controller</span>
            <small>Autenticação e Gestão de Contas</small>
        </div>

        <div id="auth-container">

            <!-- POST LOGIN -->
            <div class="op-block post">
                <div class="op-block-summary" onclick="toggleBody(this)">
                    <span class="op-block-summary-method">POST</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-path">/api/auth/login/</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-desc">Entrar no Sistema</span>
                    <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M17.418 6.109c.272-.268.709-.268.979 0s.271.701 0 .969l-7.908 7.83c-.27.268-.707.268-.979 0l-7.908-7.83c-.27-.268-.27-.701 0-.969.271-.268.709-.268.979 0L10 13.25l7.418-7.141z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="op-block-body">
                    <div class="service-rule">
                        <strong>O que isso faz?</strong> 
                        Verifica se o e-mail/username e a senha estão corretos. Se estiverem, entrega uma "Chave de Acesso" (Token).
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="validation-list">
                        <strong>⚠️ Regras de Validação:</strong>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>loginIdentifier:</strong> Obrigatório (E-mail ou Username).</li>
                            <li><strong>password:</strong> Obrigatório, Mínimo 6 caracteres.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-header">Dados para Envio (JSON)</div>
                    <div class="model-box">
<pre>{
  <span class="highlight">"loginIdentifier"</span>: <span class="string">"user@rvcarbon.com"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"password"</span>: <span class="string">"*******"</span>
}</pre>
                    </div>

                    <!-- TESTER -->
                    <div class="try-out-wrapper">
                        <button class="try-btn" onclick="toggleExecute(this)">Testar Endpoint</button>
                        <div class="execute-panel">
                            <textarea class="req-editor" id="req-login">{
  "loginIdentifier": "string",
  "password": "string"
}</textarea>
                            <button class="execute-btn" onclick="executeRequest('POST', '/api/auth/login/', 'req-login', 'res-login')">Executar</button>
                            <div class="response-box" id="res-login"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-header">Respostas Possíveis</div>
                    <table>
                        <thead><tr><th>Código</th><th>Explicação e Retorno</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-200">200</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Sucesso (Login Aprovado):</strong> Retorna suas chaves de acesso.
                                    <div class="model-box" style="margin-top:5px; font-size:10px;">
                                        { "token": "...", "refreshToken": "...", "tokenType": "bearer" }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-400">400</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Erro na Requisição:</strong> Falta preencher campos ou JSON inválido.
                                    <div class="error-example">
                                        // JSON mal formatado ou corpo vazio:<br>
                                        { "detail": "JSON inválido." }
                                        <br><br>
                                        // Campos vazios:<br>
                                        {<br>
                                        &nbsp; "password": "não deve estar em branco",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "loginIdentifier": "O e-mail ou username é obrigatório."<br>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-401">401</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Não Autorizado:</strong> Credenciais incorretas.
                                    <div class="error-example">
                                        { "details": "Usuário inexistente ou senha inválida" }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-403">403</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Acesso Negado:</strong> Usuário inativo. Necessário confirmar e-mail.
                                    <div class="error-example">
                                        { "details": "User was not activated. Please check your email..." }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- POST REGISTER -->
            <div class="op-block post">
                <div class="op-block-summary" onclick="toggleBody(this)">
                    <span class="op-block-summary-method">POST</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-path">/api/auth/register/</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-desc">Criar Nova Conta</span>
                    <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M17.418 6.109c.272-.268.709-.268.979 0s.271.701 0 .969l-7.908 7.83c-.27.268-.707.268-.979 0l-7.908-7.83c-.27-.268-.27-.701 0-.969.271-.268.709-.268.979 0L10 13.25l7.418-7.141z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="op-block-body">
                    
                    <div class="validation-list">
                        <strong>⚠️ Regras Rigorosas de Validação (Erro 400 se falhar):</strong>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>name:</strong> Min 3 letras.</li>
                            <li><strong>email:</strong> Formato válido e Min 5 letras.</li>
                            <li><strong>phone:</strong> Formato exato: <code>(XX) XXXXX-XXXX</code>.</li>
                            <li><strong>username:</strong> 3 a 30 caracteres.</li>
                            <li><strong>password:</strong> Mínimo 6 caracteres.</li>
                            <li><strong>birthday:</strong> Formato <code>yyyy-MM-dd</code> e deve ser no passado.</li>
                            <li><strong>cpfCnpj:</strong> Formato válido (ex: <code>000.000.000-00</code> ou <code>00.000.000/0000-00</code>).</li>
                            <li><strong>state, city:</strong> Obrigatórios.</li>
                            <li><strong>occupation, academicTitle:</strong> Min 2 letras.</li>
                            <li><strong>imageProfileUrl:</strong> Min 5 letras.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-header">Formulário de Cadastro</div>
                    <div class="model-box">
<pre>{
  <span class="highlight">"name"</span>: <span class="string">"João Silva"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"email"</span>: <span class="string">"joao@email.com"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"phone"</span>: <span class="string">"(11) 99999-9999"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"username"</span>: <span class="string">"joaosilva"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"password"</span>: <span class="string">"secret123"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"birthday"</span>: <span class="string">"1990-01-01"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"state"</span>: <span class="string">"SP"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"city"</span>: <span class="string">"São Paulo"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"cpfCnpj"</span>: <span class="string">"123.456.789-00"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"occupation"</span>: <span class="string">"Agrônomo"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"academicTitle"</span>: <span class="string">"Doutor"</span>,
  <span class="highlight">"imageProfileUrl"</span>: <span class="string">"http://..."</span>
}</pre>
                    </div>

                      <!-- TESTER -->
                      <div class="try-out-wrapper">
                        <button class="try-btn" onclick="toggleExecute(this)">Testar Endpoint</button>
                        <div class="execute-panel">
                            <textarea class="req-editor" id="req-register">{
  "name": "string",
  "email": "string",
  "phone": "(11) 99999-9999",
  "username": "string",
  "password": "string",
  "birthday": "2000-01-01",
  "state": "string",
  "city": "string",
  "cpfCnpj": "000.000.000-00",
  "occupation": "string",
  "academicTitle": "string",
  "imageProfileUrl": "string"
}</textarea>
                            <button class="execute-btn" onclick="executeRequest('POST', '/api/auth/register/', 'req-register', 'res-register')">Executar</button>
                            <div class="response-box" id="res-register"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-header">Respostas Possíveis</div>
                    <table>
                          <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-200">200</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Sucesso (Cadastro Realizado):</strong> Retorna o usuário criado.
                                    <div class="model-box" style="margin-top:5px; font-size:10px;">
                                        {<br>
                                        &nbsp; "userId": 1, "name": "joao", "email": "jvglima03@gmail.com",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "phone": null, "cpfCnpj": "999.999.999-99", "state": "go",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "city": "rio quente", "birthday": "2003-03-20", ...<br>
                                        }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="status-badge status-400">400</span></td>
                                <td>
                                    <strong>Erros de Validação (Campos Inválidos):</strong>
                                    <div class="error-example">
                                        // Mapa Plano de Erros (Campo: Mensagem):<br>
                                        {<br>
                                        &nbsp; "password": "A senha (password) deve ter no mínimo 6 caracteres.",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "name": "O nome (name) deve ter pelo menos 3 caracteres.",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "cpfCnpj": "O CPF ou CNPJ (cpfCnpj) está em formato inválido.",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "email": "O email (email) deve ser válido.",<br>
                                        &nbsp; "birthday": "A data de nascimento (birthday) deve estar no passado."<br>
                                        }
                                        <br><br>
                                        // Erro de Parsing (Data/Tipo inválido):<br>
                                        { "detail": "Campo 'birthday' tem valor inválido. Use o formato yyyy-MM-dd." }
                                        <br><br>
                                        // Duplicidade (E-mail/Username já existe):<br>
                                        { "email": "email já está em uso.", "username": "username já está em uso." }
                                    </div>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- POST REFRESH -->
            <div class="op-block post">
                <div class="op-block-summary" onclick="toggleBody(this)">
                    <span class="op-block-summary-method">POST</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-path">/api/auth/refresh/</span>
                    <span class="op-block-summary-desc">Renovar Sessão</span>
                    <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M17.418 6.109c.272-.268.709-.268.979 0s.271.701 0 .969l-7.908 7.83c-.27.268-.707.268-.979 0l-7.908-7.83c-.27-.268-.27-.701 0-.969.271-.268.709-.268.979 0L10 13.25l7.418-7.141z"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="op-block-body">
                    <div class="validation-list">
                        <strong>⚠️ Regras:</strong>
                        <ul><li><strong>refreshToken:</strong> Obrigatório. É a chave secundária recebida no login.</li></ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="model-box"><pre>{ "refreshToken": "string" }</pre></div>

                    <!-- TESTER -->
                    <div class="try-out-wrapper">
                        <button class="try-btn" onclick="toggleExecute(this)">Testar Endpoint</button>
                        <div class="execute-panel">
                            <textarea class="req-editor" id="req-refresh">{ "refreshToken": "string" }</textarea>
                            <button class="execute-btn" onclick="executeRequest('POST', '/api/auth/refresh/', 'req-refresh', 'res-refresh')">Executar</button>
                            <div class="response-box" id="res-refresh"></div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="section-header">Respostas Possíveis</div>
                    <table>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="status-badge status-200">200</span></td>
                            <td>
                                <strong>Sucesso:</strong> Retorna um novo par de chaves de acesso.
                                <div class="model-box" style="margin-top:5px; font-size:10px;">
                                    { "token": "...", "refreshToken": "...", "tokenType": "bearer" }
                                </div>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="status-badge status-400">400</span></td>
                            <td>
                                <strong>Erro na Requisição:</strong> Enviou Token errado (ex: AccessToken em vez de Refresh).
